    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo out now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Ballers play with Controllers!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/b9da48e2858aa8973ae59297e8a0ca22.poster.avif?t=1729254120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/b9da48e2858aa8973ae59297e8a0ca22.webm?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/b9da48e2858aa8973ae59297e8a0ca22.mp4?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F</strong>eatures</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Multiplayer Chaos for 2-4 Players:</strong> Grab your friends for fast-paced local action in free for all or team battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Crazy Items to Take Control:</strong> Pick up and use quirky items to gain the upper hand. Knock the ball loose, KO opponents with a perfectly timed throw, and change the flow of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Gameplay:</strong> Chase or be chased! The roles flip in an instant as players swap between running for the ball or escaping with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels With Gimmicks:</strong> Each arena is packed with its own twists and challenges, testing your platforming and strategic thinking skills in new ways. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam remote play:</strong>\u00a0Play with friends online through Steam Remote Play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/09a180d17628898e6dca11c9e7bac118.poster.avif?t=1729254120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/09a180d17628898e6dca11c9e7bac118.webm?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/09a180d17628898e6dca11c9e7bac118.mp4?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fast-paced platformer sports game where quick reflexes and smart tactics are key. Race to capture totems, outplay opponents, and secure victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into competitive couch multiplayer with Free-for-All and Team-based modes, where every match is fast, unpredictable, and action-packed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/bad40a5384bc1caf6d31d171e3a88638.poster.avif?t=1729254120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/bad40a5384bc1caf6d31d171e3a88638.webm?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/bad40a5384bc1caf6d31d171e3a88638.mp4?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about the thrill of chasing and escaping. When you're not holding the ball, hunt down the ball-holder. Once you have it, outmaneuver your opponents to capture totems and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring won\u2019t be easy\u2014your rivals will do everything to knock the ball from your hands. With constant shifts between offense and defense, the fast-paced gameplay rewards both strategy and skill.   </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/b9da48e2858aa8973ae59297e8a0ca22.poster.avif?t=1729254120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/b9da48e2858aa8973ae59297e8a0ca22.webm?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/b9da48e2858aa8973ae59297e8a0ca22.mp4?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F</strong>eatures</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Multiplayer Chaos for 2-4 Players:</strong> Grab your friends for fast-paced local action in free for all or team battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Crazy Items to Take Control:</strong> Pick up and use quirky items to gain the upper hand. Knock the ball loose, KO opponents with a perfectly timed throw, and change the flow of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Gameplay:</strong> Chase or be chased! The roles flip in an instant as players swap between running for the ball or escaping with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels With Gimmicks:</strong> Each arena is packed with its own twists and challenges, testing your platforming and strategic thinking skills in new ways. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam remote play:</strong>\u00a0Play with friends online through Steam Remote Play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/09a180d17628898e6dca11c9e7bac118.poster.avif?t=1729254120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/09a180d17628898e6dca11c9e7bac118.webm?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/09a180d17628898e6dca11c9e7bac118.mp4?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fast-paced platformer sports game where quick reflexes and smart tactics are key. Race to capture totems, outplay opponents, and secure victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into competitive couch multiplayer with Free-for-All and Team-based modes, where every match is fast, unpredictable, and action-packed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/bad40a5384bc1caf6d31d171e3a88638.poster.avif?t=1729254120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/bad40a5384bc1caf6d31d171e3a88638.webm?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429480/extras/bad40a5384bc1caf6d31d171e3a88638.mp4?t=1729254120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about the thrill of chasing and escaping. When you're not holding the ball, hunt down the ball-holder. Once you have it, outmaneuver your opponents to capture totems and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring won\u2019t be easy\u2014your rivals will do everything to knock the ball from your hands. With constant shifts between offense and defense, the fast-paced gameplay rewards both strategy and skill.   </p>",
    "short_description": "Capture totems and outplay your opponents in this frantic platformer sports game. Dive into chaotic free-for-all or team-based battles, using dynamic movement and tactical items to gain the edge. Discover powerful pickups and strategize your way to victory!",
